1
00:04:35,555 --> 00:04:41,555
The park is open.

2
00:09:11,111 --> 00:09:17,111
Jurassic World is a action, adventure, science
fiction film directed by Colin Trevorrow.

3
00:13:46,666 --> 00:13:52,666
Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning
dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.

4
00:18:22,222 --> 00:18:28,222
Owen, played by Chris Pratt.

5
00:22:57,777 --> 00:23:03,777
Claire, played by Bryce Dallas Howard.

6
00:27:33,333 --> 00:27:39,333
Masrani, played by Irrfan Khan.

7
00:32:08,888 --> 00:32:14,888
Hoskins, played by Vincent D'Onofrio.

8
00:36:44,444 --> 00:36:50,444
Gray, played by Ty Simpkins.

9
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Zach, played by Nick Robinson.

10
00:45:55,555 --> 00:46:01,555
Jurassic World Rebirth is a 2025 American science fiction action film
directed by Gareth Edwards and written by David Koepp.

11
00:50:31,111 --> 00:50:37,111
It is the fourth Jurassic World film, as well as the seventh
installment overall in the Jurassic Park franchise.

12
00:55:06,666 --> 00:55:12,666
The film features Scarlett Johansson, Mahershala Ali, Jonathan
Bailey, Rupert Friend, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, and Ed Skrein.

13
00:59:42,222 --> 00:59:48,222
In Jurassic World Rebirth, the world's de-extinct dinosaurs live around the
equator, which provides the last viable climate for them to survive.

14
01:04:17,777 --> 01:04:23,777
A team travels to a former island research facility where three specific gigantic species of dinosaurs
reside, with the goal of extracting samples that are vital for a heart disease treatment.

15
01:08:53,333 --> 01:08:59,333
The team also rescues a shipwrecked family, and both groups struggle
to survive after becoming stranded on the island.

16
01:13:28,888 --> 01:13:34,888
Work on the film began shortly after the release of Jurassic World Dominion, when executive producer
Steven Spielberg recruited Koepp to help him develop a new installment in the series.

17
01:18:04,444 --> 01:18:10,444
Koepp previously co-wrote the original Jurassic Park film (1993) and
wrote its sequel, The Lost World: Jurassic Park (1997).

18
01:22:40,000 --> 01:22:46,000
Development of Rebirth was first reported in January 2024.

19
01:27:15,555 --> 01:27:21,555
Edwards was hired as director a month later, and
casting commenced shortly thereafter.

20
01:31:51,111 --> 01:31:57,111
Principal photography took place in Thailand, Malta, and the
United Kingdom from June to September 2024.

21
01:36:26,666 --> 01:36:32,666
Jurassic World Rebirth premiered on June 17, 2025, at Odeon Luxe Leicester Square in London, and
was released in the United States and Canada by Universal Pictures on July 2.

22
01:41:02,222 --> 01:41:08,222
The film received mixed reviews from critics, though some
deemed it an improvement over previous entries.

23
01:45:37,777 --> 01:45:43,777
It became the sixth-highest-grossing film of 2025, and grossed over $869
million worldwide against a budget of $180–225 million.

24
01:50:13,333 --> 01:50:19,333
At the 98th Academy Awards, it was nominated for Best Visual Effects, making it the first film in Jurassic
Park franchise since The Lost World (1997) to receive an Oscar nomination in any category.

25
01:54:48,888 --> 01:54:54,888
The film explores themes of island, primal fear, escape, velociraptor, dna.

26
01:59:24,444 --> 01:59:30,444
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking and intense.
